From c7c7c8316a8c47f47286f77c59af99902fa96756 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paperclip Agent <agent@togetherweown.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:56:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(signature): add account provenance tag for Muse
 reasoning envelopes

Meta binds each reasoning encrypted_content envelope to the account that
issued it and rejects a replay through any other account. Add a meta#<account>#<envelope>
tag on top of the existing provider-prefix mechanism so the Meta executor can later tell
whether an envelope came from the credential it selected.

Detection still never claims a tagged envelope for any provider, so every other
lane treats it exactly like the raw envelope: foreign.
